cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article.
title: Fully automated deep learning pipeline for L3-level body composition analysis in ADPKD
abstract: >-
  Training, end-to-end inference, evaluation and figure code for a fully automated
  pipeline that segments the L3 vertebra, selects the L3 inferior endplate and L3
  middle reference sections, and measures skeletal muscle, visceral fat,
  subcutaneous fat and intramuscular adipose tissue on abdominal CT.
type: software
